# Requiem for the Departed (crystalWar 23, call-only), level 30: a level 30 Warrior in the Eldieme Necropolis [S]
# (missions as the main flow). No ribbon: Heptachiond's script 104. The ribbon (a GM), level 30 exactly: 105, finished:
# the quest added.
lists TheEldiemeNecropolisS/Heptachiond/onTrigger TheEldiemeNecropolisS/onEventFinish/105
char zone=TheEldiemeNecropolisS pos=257.696,-31.999,20.073 job=WAR lvl=30
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
trigger Heptachiond                     # no ribbon, level 30: 104
finish
keyitem BronzeRibbonOfService           # a GM
trigger Heptachiond                     # the ribbon, level 30: 105
finish                                  # the quest added
